# CAOstack core

- Read AGENTS.md and PROJECT-STATE.md before mutation.
- Skills are a catalog. Open a SKILL.md only when this task needs it. Never load solvys-skills.
- CAO does not write product code. poteto-agent-1 and poteto-agent-2 implement. Supervisor reviews the pushed branch.
- Names in context. Secret values stay in Workspace Vault or Computer. Never print cookies, tokens, or 2FA codes.
- No Anthropic products.
- User-prompted deploy is authorization. Unprompted production destroy, force-push to shared branches, and customer messages pause.
- Design while building uses shadcn-cssinjs. Polish after uses Impeccable.
